<hr data-start="1282" data-end="1285">
<h2 data-section-id="7lag6j" data-start="1287" data-end="1307">⚠️ Common mistake</h2>
<p data-start="1309" data-end="1404">You might be in the <strong data-start="1329" data-end="1347">backend folder</strong>, but the <code data-start="1357" data-end="1362">dev</code> script exists in the <strong data-start="1384" data-end="1403">frontend folder</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1406" data-end="1427">👉 Example structure:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1428" data-end="1509"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>bookmyglam/</span><br><span>  ├── backend/</span><br><span>  └── frontend/   &lt;-- dev script might be here</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1511" data-end="1573">Make sure you're running the command in the correct directory.</p>
<hr data-start="1575" data-end="1578">
<h2 data-section-id="1drqi6" data-start="1580" data-end="1605">🚀 Quick Fix Checklist</h2>
<ul data-start="1607" data-end="1760">
<li data-section-id="13bgmnz" data-start="1607" data-end="1648">
<p data-start="1609" data-end="1648">Run <code data-start="1613" data-end="1622">npm run</code> → see available scripts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="svj73s" data-start="1649" data-end="1692">
<p data-start="1651" data-end="1692">Open <code data-start="1656" data-end="1670">package.json</code> → check <code data-start="1679" data-end="1690">"scripts"</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="o08qpa" data-start="1693" data-end="1725">
<p data-start="1695" data-end="1725">Use <code data-start="1699" data-end="1710">npm start</code> if available</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10bb87f" data-start="1726" data-end="1760">
<p data-start="1728" data-end="1760">Or add your own <code data-start="1744" data-end="1751">"dev"</code> script</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1762" data-end="1765">
