<p data-start="165" data-end="205">👉 <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">React Router</span></span></p>
<hr data-start="207" data-end="210">
<h1 data-section-id="1na3aka" data-start="212" data-end="238">🧠 Routing kya hota hai?</h1>
<p data-start="240" data-end="293">Routing = <strong data-start="250" data-end="293">URL ke basis pe different pages dikhana</strong></p>
<p data-start="295" data-end="303">Example:</p>
<ul data-start="305" data-end="376">
<li data-section-id="19k8he1" data-start="305" data-end="324">
<p data-start="307" data-end="324"><code data-start="307" data-end="310">/</code> → Home page</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ckjiue" data-start="325" data-end="350">
<p data-start="327" data-end="350"><code data-start="327" data-end="335">/about</code> → About page</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9upy92" data-start="351" data-end="376">
<p data-start="353" data-end="376"><code data-start="353" data-end="361">/login</code> → Login page</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="378" data-end="424">👉 Without page reload (SPA = Single Page App)</p>
<hr data-start="426" data-end="429">
