<hr data-start="163" data-end="166">
<h1 data-section-id="1nb1bz6" data-start="168" data-end="202">🧠 STEP 0: Routing kya hota hai?</h1>
<p data-start="204" data-end="270">👉 Routing = URL change hone pe <strong data-start="236" data-end="270">different component show karna</strong></p>
<p data-start="272" data-end="280">Example:</p>
<ul data-start="282" data-end="352">
<li data-section-id="sm2ue2" data-start="282" data-end="296">
<p data-start="284" data-end="296"><code data-start="284" data-end="287">/</code> → Home</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9upy92" data-start="297" data-end="322">
<p data-start="299" data-end="322"><code data-start="299" data-end="307">/login</code> → Login page</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1w9rleu" data-start="323" data-end="352">
<p data-start="325" data-end="352"><code data-start="325" data-end="335">/profile</code> → Profile page</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="354" data-end="386">👉 Sab bina page reload ke (SPA)</p>
<hr data-start="388" data-end="391">
