<h1 data-section-id="i1mp08" data-start="768" data-end="795">🧩 STEP 3: Simple Routing</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="wqrrdz" data-start="797" data-end="811"><span role="text">👉 <code data-start="803" data-end="811">App.js</code></span></h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="813" data-end="1153"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼg">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼm">Routes</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">Route</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼg">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼk">"react-router-dom"</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">Home</span><span>() {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼg">return</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>Home Page</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">Login</span><span>() {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼg">return</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>Login Page</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">App</span><span>() {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼg">return</span><span> (</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Routes&gt;</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Route</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">path</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"/"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">element</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>{</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Home</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><span>} </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Route</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">path</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"/login"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">element</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>{</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Login</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><span>} </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/Routes&gt;</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">export</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">default</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">App</span><span>;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1155" data-end="1158">
<h1 data-section-id="hxxhve" data-start="1160" data-end="1183">🔗 STEP 4: Navigation</h1>
<p data-start="1185" data-end="1237">👉 <code data-start="1188" data-end="1193">&lt;a&gt;</code> tag use mat karo ❌<br data-start="1212" data-end="1215">
👉 <code data-start="1218" data-end="1226">&lt;Link&gt;</code> use karo ✅</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1239" data-end="1412"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼg">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼm">Link</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼg">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼk">"react-router-dom"</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">Navbar</span><span>() {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼg">return</span><span> (</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;&gt;</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Link</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">to</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"/"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Home</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/Link&gt;</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Link</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">to</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"/login"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Login</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/Link&gt;</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/&gt;</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1414" data-end="1417">
<h1 data-section-id="p9bshf" data-start="1419" data-end="1446">⚡ STEP 5: Dynamic Routing</h1>
