ass="ͼo">&lt;Routes&gt;</span><br><span>        </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Route</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">path</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"/"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">element</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>{</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Home</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><span>} </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><br><span>        </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Route</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">path</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"/login"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">element</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>{</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;Login</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><span>} </span><span class="ͼo">/&gt;</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/Routes&gt;</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/BrowserRouter&gt;</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">export</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">default</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">App</span><span>;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="686" data-end="689">
<h1 data-section-id="33sc7d" data-start="691" data-end="731">🔍 Line-by-line Explanation (Hinglish)</h1>
