<p data-start="1370" data-end="1390">👉 Kaise track kare?</p>
<ol data-start="1392" data-end="1504">
<li data-section-id="1x06ar3" data-start="1392" data-end="1413">
<p data-start="1395" data-end="1413">App.js open karo</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1av3bnr" data-start="1414" data-end="1447">
<p data-start="1417" data-end="1447">Dekho kya import ho raha hai</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="f31lxl" data-start="1448" data-end="1471">
<p data-start="1451" data-end="1471">Fir us file me jao</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ymcs0d" data-start="1472" data-end="1504">
<p data-start="1475" data-end="1504">Usme bhi imports check karo</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="1506" data-end="1529">👉 Ye chain follow karo</p>
<hr data-start="1531" data-end="1534">
<h1 data-section-id="15t7nug" data-start="1536" data-end="1571">🧪 STEP 5: Browser DevTools trick</h1>
<p data-start="1573" data-end="1602">👉 App run karo (<code data-start="1590" data-end="1601">npm start</code>)</p>
<ol data-start="1604" data-end="1719">
<li data-section-id="aafbhs" data-start="1604" data-end="1630">
<p data-start="1607" data-end="1630">Right click → Inspect</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="myfz4a" data-start="1631" data-end="1672">
<p data-start="1634" data-end="1672">React tab (React DevTools extension)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1m00wcu" data-start="1673" data-end="1719">
<p data-start="1676" data-end="1719">Dekho kaunsa component render ho raha hai</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1721" data-end="1724">
<h1 data-section-id="kka07a" data-start="1726" data-end="1758">⚡ STEP 6: Console trick (easy)</h1>
<p data-start="1760" data-end="1774">File me likho:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1776" data-end="1832"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼm">console</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>log(</span><span class="ͼk">"Login page loaded"</span><span>);</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1834" data-end="1937">👉 Jab page open hoga → console me dikhega<br data-start="1876" data-end="1879">
👉 Tum confirm kar sakte ho ki kaunsi file run ho rahi hai</p>
<hr data-start="1939" data-end="1942">
<h1 data-section-id="1bnu07i" data-start="1944" data-end="1961">🧠 Golden Rules</h1>
<p data-start="1963" data-end="2116">✔ <code data-start="1965" data-end="1973">import</code> = file connect karta hai<br data-start="1998" data-end="2001">
✔ <code data-start="2003" data-end="2018">&lt;Component /&gt;</code> = file call hoti hai<br data-start="2039" data-end="2042">
✔ <code data-start="2044" data-end="2051">Route</code> = URL → component mapping<br data-start="2077" data-end="2080">
✔ Parent → child ko call karta hai</p>
<hr data-start="2118" data-end="2121">
