<p data-start="2299" data-end="2316">Login.js render</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="2318" data-end="2321">
<h1 data-section-id="77zawx" data-start="2323" data-end="2344">🚀 Hinglish Summary</h1>
<ul data-start="2346" data-end="2500">
<li data-section-id="memtdg" data-start="2346" data-end="2406">
<p data-start="2348" data-end="2406">File kaha call ho rahi hai → <code data-start="2377" data-end="2385">import</code> se pata chalta hai</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6un5na" data-start="2407" data-end="2461">
<p data-start="2409" data-end="2461">Kab run hoti hai → <code data-start="2428" data-end="2443">&lt;Component /&gt;</code> ya <code data-start="2447" data-end="2456">&lt;Route&gt;</code> se</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="n77l4l" data-start="2462" data-end="2500">
<p data-start="2464" data-end="2500">Chain follow karo → parent → child</p>
</li>
</ul>
